.TH "TODOPRO GITHUB SYNC" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro github sync Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-github\-sync \- Sync a linked GitHub Project...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro github sync
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sync a linked GitHub Project bidirectionally (Pro).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-link\fP TEXT
Link id to sync
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fP
Sync all of your GitHub Project links
.TP
\fB\-\-strategy\fP TEXT
Conflict strategy: last-write-wins, todopro-wins, or github-wins  [default: last-write-wins]
